[Metro Board file 2026-0785, Motion / Motion Response]
APPROVE Motion by Bass, Dupont-Walker, Mitchell, Butts, and Solis to direct the CEO to: 

A.	Rename the Metro station currently known as "Pershing Square" to "Biddy Mason," in honor of Biddy Mason and to recognize her lasting impact on Los Angeles and the Downtown Los Angeles Community;

B.	Update current transit signage, maps, geographic information data, and relevant markers used for customer wayfinding and navigation to identify the updated Biddy Mason Station in a manner that is timely and cost-efficient to the agency;

C.	Notify the City of Los Angeles, surrounding local businesses, community organizations, and other key stakeholders of the name change in advance of the official rollout; and

D.	Launch a public awareness campaign via social media Metro's website, and any other outlets at Metro's disposal to insure the public is informed of the upcoming change.
